{"aggregate_id": "01KZ6DBHC7ER3SC3M2TPHWWQ70", "aggregate_type": "Mission", "event_id": "01KZ6DBHFN2QPT31Y5HJP1BAXJ", "event_type": "MissionCreated", "payload": {"created_at": "2026-08-04T12:53:09.640047+00:00", "friendly_name": "A live console: the hub working, and each agent's own page", "mission_id": "01KZ6DBHC7ER3SC3M2TPHWWQ70", "mission_number": null, "mission_slug": "live-console-agent-page-01KZ6DBH", "mission_type": "software-dev", "purpose_context": "Closes #46 and #51 (which absorbed #22). The console polls nothing: it holds one upstream SSE connection to the hub and re-emits on its own origin, so connect-src 'self' stands and N operators cost the hub one listener. Design is settled and reviewed by the owner. New API surface is required: a hub-wide event stream and snapshot, and an observed outbox route, which does not exist today \u2014 /actors/{name}/outbox is a POST for sending, and neither house.py nor mailbox.py has any sent-side query.", "purpose_tldr": "One held connection feeds a hub-wide Realtime tab and an agent's own page, which absorbs /mailbox/{name} and shows identity, provenance-labelled profile facts, and mail in both directions.", "target_branch": "main", "wp_count": 0}, "project_slug": "agent-mail", "project_uuid": "d4029717-cdee-49ee-a034-fea8e7368926", "schema_version": "5.0.0", "timestamp": "2026-08-04T12:53:09.749648+00:00"}
